    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31846" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκδέρω</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκδερμᾰτ-δείρω</span></b> , fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-δερῶ,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>strip off the skin from</i>
			one, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κριὸν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					2.42
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				7.26
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			) ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Dialex.</u>
					2.11
				</span></i>
			 ; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δῶκε δέ μ᾽ ἐκδείρας ἀσκὸν βοός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					10.19
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βύρσαν ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>El.</u>
					824
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>cudgel soundly, 'hide',</i>
