			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hyp.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				200
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PSI</u>
				4.403
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span> :— 
				Pass.
			, Machoap.<i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				13.580b
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			).</div>
